# Hotaru: fireflies blink, and in waves fall into step; a blink is a note (its height), blinks together a
# soft chord; frogs call and answer; a shakuhachi now and then; white keys release a firefly, black keys scatter
# (ZEN-1 boots into Sakura; PRESETS twice: Hotaru)
wait 800
spin PRESET 1
wait 300
spin PRESET 1
wait 1000
expect scene 2
expect knob2 0
expect knob7 30
expect knob4 50
expect knob5 30
expect knob6 20
expect knob9 0
expect knob8 3
expect knob13 0
# DRIFT, KNOB 4: the weather held clear for this test (Auto picks each night: mist and
# rain mean fewer fireflies); MOOD: Mood, Depth, Melody (Height), Arc 30
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
spin K1 1
expect knob13 1
expect knob0 0
expect tweaks 1
expect knob11 0
expect knob14 0
expect knob15 50
expect wx 0
# Natural: a few at dusk, the rest coming out over ~4 min
expect fireflies >0
expect fireflies <4
# free at first, then the coupling rises: in step within ~3 min
wait 30000
expect insync <80
wait 150000
expect insync >90
expect blinks >30
expect pulses >15
expect scnotes >40
expect frogcalls >5
expect owls >0
expect stars >0
expect nvoices <13
shot hotaru.png
# black keys: a note each, low to high over the white keys' sixteen (b0 -> 6, b4 -> 13, b9 -> 21), a firefly
# flashing with it
tapkey b0
wait 20
expect relkey 6
tapkey b4
wait 20
expect relkey 13
tapkey b9
wait 20
expect relkey 21
expect flashes 3
# the top black key: the clearing breeze carries every firefly off to the right; new ones rise after it
tapkey b10
wait 50
expect scatters 1
wait 14000
expect fireflies <3
wait 30000
expect fireflies >1
# a white key: a firefly rises at that note, heard at once
tapkey w10
wait 100
expect released 1
expect relkey 16
expect fireflies >3
# sixteen notes, each its own, rising from 6 (w0 -> 6 .. w15 -> 21)
tapkey w1
wait 100
expect relkey 7
tapkey w3
wait 100
expect relkey 9
tapkey w15
wait 100
expect relkey 21
expect released 4
# Music: Phrases (a list: Height -> Across -> Own -> Loops -> Height)
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
spin K3 1
expect knob14 1
spin K3 3
expect knob14 0
wait 240000
# they fall into step and drift apart again: at some point in these minutes, out of step
expect insyncmin <75
# MIX: Frogs to 0: no more calls
tap FX
tap FX
spin K4 -60
expect knob7 0
wait 1000
expect frogcalls >0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
shot hotaru-regrown.png
# back to the instrument: everything of the field lets go
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 4000
expect mode 0
expect nvoices 0
# only what changed is sent to the screen; the screen as sent always matches the frame as drawn
expect stale 0
expect race 0
